    {
      "text": "###key-value pair\n*Whenever you\nsee ByKey in a method name, it means that you can perform this only on a PairRDD type. The\neasiest way is to just map over your current RDD to a basic key–value structure. This means\nhaving two values in each record of your RDD*\n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "d7b44247b3b343bebaf0b"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\n//lookup: lookup for pariticular keys\n\nkeyword.lookup('S')  //keyword.lookup('S').length",
